  "description": "Come home to breathtaking sea views in Dalkey\r\n\r\nThe Lookout, Harbour Road in South Co Dublin is a residential development of modern apartments overlooking Dalkey Island. Inspired by Dalkey’s historical terraces, these two apartment buildings offer unrivalled views, chic design and convenient commuting to Dublin city centre in just 30 minutes.\r\n\r\nHome to artists, writers, and musicians, Dalkey has a rich cultural heritage and vibrant community, and is filled with artisan boutiques, bustling cafés, and award-winning restaurants. While stunning coastal walks, yacht clubs, sports facilities, schools, and parks nearby offer activities for all ages.\r\n\r\nThe Lookout offers a range of 1, 2 and 3 bedroom options, these homes are available to rent now. \r\n\r\nSpacious, sustainable and elegant, the design of these bright and airy apartments reflect their coastal location. Each home includes a variety of enviable features including:\r\n\r\n•\tBoConcept styling and furniture \r\n•\tFloor to ceiling large windows\r\n•\tLarge open plan living \r\n•\tLarge balconies with sea and landscape views \r\n•\tNEFF and Miele appliances \r\n•\tGenerous storage areas\r\n•\tIntegrated kitchens with quartz countertops\r\n•\tUtility room with separate washing machine and dryer\r\n•\tFully tiled bathrooms\r\n•\tBuilt in wardrobes\r\n•\tVideo intercom \r\n•\tExcellent A2 / A3 energy rating \r\n•\tUnderground parking \r\n•\tSecure bicycle storage\r\n\t\r\nSet in beautifully landscaped gardens, all apartments have balconies with the majority offering views of the sea and surrounding landscape.\r\nDesigned to anticipate residents’ needs they come complete with a range of fantastic amenities.\r\n\r\n•\tExclusive residents’ gym\r\n•\tResidents’ work hub\r\n•\tConcierge service\r\n•\tResidents’ lounge\r\n•\tKitchen and dining area \r\n•\tMyPup parcel management \r\n•\tPet friendly options \r\n•\tLandscaped gardens\r\n\r\nFor more information, contact us to arrange a viewing.\r\n\r\n*Please note that prices vary depending on size, floor, and aspect. Prices outlined are the starting prices.",
